			"notes": "# Tacos-Mod 1.1.0\n\nView the [README](https://github.com/Tyler127/Tacos-Mod/blob/v1.1.0/README.md) file for more information on the items and their crafting recipes.\n\n## Changelog\n\n### Added\n- Added a creative mode tab for Tacos Mod items\n- Chicken Taco item\n- Dr Pepper potion\n- Dr Pepper Syrup item\n- Fish Taco item\n- Mountain Dew potion\n- Mountain Dew Syrup item\n- Pork Taco item\n- Pulled Pork item\n- Shredded Chicken item\n- Suspicious Taco item\n\n### Fixed\n- Fixed an issue where the Baja Blast Syrup item was registered as a Beef Taco item\n- Fixed the Beef Taco item's texture to no longer have a black background\n\n### Updated\n- Reduced Baja Blast potion's Flight status effect duration to three minutes\n- Reduced the Crunchwrap Supreme item's Resistance status effect to level two\n- Reduced the Crunchwrap Supreme item's Fire Resistance status effect to level two\n- Improved the Raw Tortilla recipe to give two Raw Tortillas\n\n## Dependencies\n- Minecraft 26.3\n- Fabric API 0.162.0\n- Fabric Loader 0.19.5\n\n## New Contributors\n* @ryan-reisdorf made their first contribution in https://github.com/Tyler127/Tacos-Mod/pull/2"
